prompt_template:
Create a premium future-sport footwear concept board.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Athlete and gesture: {SUBJECT}
Setting, modules and palette: {SCENE}
Exact short title: {MAIN_TEXT}. Render only this title once in small clean uppercase grotesk; any secondary labeling must remain tiny and sparse.
Concept direction: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Build a refined modular editorial composition from two to four clean image panels with consistent gutters: include one highly legible close product/outsole view and one human-scale athletic or quiet moment. Make the podded sole and body gesture tell one sensory story. Cool ice-blue and graphite architecture, signal-coral outsole details, realistic skin, rubber and knit, polished studio campaign photography. No branding or copied source layout. Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}.
